  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Yellow golden Relic Gu is the rank four member of the Relic Gu series on Qing Mao Mountain.",
        "chapters": [
          111
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_relic_gu",
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later receives one as a King Xin Inheritance reward on San Cha Mountain and uses it there.",
        "chapters": [
          358
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "inh_king_xin_inheritance",
          "loc_san_cha_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When land spirit Ba Gui opens the stores tied to Second Aperture Gu, Fang Yuan counts over ten yellow gold Relic Gu beside eight purple crystal Relic Gu and judges that using those stores would push him to rank five peak stage within moments.",
        "chapters": [
          378
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "san-cha-stores",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ba_gui",
          "gu_second_aperture_gu",
          "gu_purple_crystal_relic_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan gives Chang Ji You a yellow gold Relic Gu said to be enough to reach rank four peak stage, plus a purple crystal Relic Gu for rank five progress. Chang Ji You later sits and takes a yellow gold Relic Gu into his aperture, and after three days of using all the Relic Gu left for him he reaches rank five upper stage.",
        "chapters": [
          589
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "gift-to-chang-ji-you",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_chang_ji_you"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Mortal markets at best circulate white silver Relic Gu; yellow gold Relic Gu stay controlled and rare with higher-ups, while treasure yellow heaven still has few of them. Relic Gu can only form naturally; Gu Immortals, including those of Lang Ya blessed land and Heavenly Court, cannot create them, because they are human path Gu worms that form more readily where many humans or variant humans live.",
        "chapters": [
          1796
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "human-path-form",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
          "fac_heavenly_court",
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
